Created the 17 hook definitions under `.kiro/hooks/`, their 16 shared Bash scripts under `scripts/kiro-hooks/`, and:

- `docs/kiro-log/hooks-testing.md`
- `docs/kiro-log/hooks-questions.md`

No commands or tests were run, as requested. The files were reviewed with file-reading tools only.

All hooks use `"version": "v1"` and `"action": { "type": "command" }`. `guard-read-secrets` shares `guard-secrets.sh`.

| Hook | Event | Blocks or informs |
|---|---|---|
| `rust-fmt-on-save` | `PostFileSave` | Informs |
| `rust-check-on-save` | `PostFileSave` | Informs |
| `engine-tests-on-save` | `PostFileSave` | Informs |
| `ghost-hunt-on-test-failure` | `PostToolUse` | Informs, never blocks |
| `guard-secrets` | `PreToolUse` | Blocks with exit 2 |
| `guard-read-secrets` | `PreToolUse` | Blocks with exit 2 |
| `guard-dangerous-shell` | `PreToolUse` | Blocks with exit 2 |
| `licence-check-on-deps` | `PostFileSave` | Informs |
| `web-check-on-save` | `PostFileSave` | Informs |
| `pack-validate` | `PostFileSave` | Informs |
| `spdx-header-on-create` | `PostFileCreate` | Informs |
| `pre-task-green` | `PreTaskExec` | Informs, always exits 0 |
| `task-done-changelog` | `PostTaskExec` | Informs |
| `stop-session-log` | `Stop` | Informs |
| `session-start-context` | `SessionStart` | Informs |
| `prompt-secret-filter` | `UserPromptSubmit` | Blocks with exit 2 |
| `precompact-snapshot` | `PreCompact` | Informs |

The testing documentation covers the required `.env`, `.env.example`, `docker run --privileged`, and `cargo test | tail` checks.
